contract Lists
parties we

record Batch
  codes list text at most 2000
  tags list text
  sizes list number at most 4

can load by we with rows list number at most 3
  each entry in tags
    requires entry = "x"
  each n in 5
    requires n > 0
  sizes = (1, 2, 3, 4, 5)
  requires count of rows > 0
  requires sum of tags = "a"
